# Where the sandbox gets its upstream aurora and dms Terraform modules.
#
# Copy to upstream.env (gitignored) or export the same variables, then run
#   uv run python scripts/sandbox.py fetch-upstream
# from examples/sandbox. The modules land in ./upstream (gitignored) at the pinned commit.
#
# Any repository works whose modules/aurora and modules/dms satisfy the contract in
# docs/upstream-modules-contract.md (outputs the orchestrator reads, behaviour it relies on).
# Patches in upstream-patches/*.patch, if present, are applied after the checkout.
#
# UPSTREAM_MODULES_GIT: clone URL of the modules repository.
# UPSTREAM_MODULES_REF: full 40-character commit sha; branch and tag names are refused.
#   For the reference implementation use a commit at or after 08def61: from there its dms
#   module keys the secret-access roles statically and sends max_file_size for PostgreSQL
#   targets (contract 2.3 and 2.6), and the sandbox carries no workaround for either.

UPSTREAM_MODULES_GIT=https://example.com/<org>/<modules-repo>.git
UPSTREAM_MODULES_REF=<commit-sha>
